# Fleetbreak Moorings (CIPlay fleetbreak_moorings): the chart room, the articles, the bosun's locker (machete), the
# vines on the stair cut, the boars in the roof garden, the fuel tank and fuel pipe, Teo's log, the biofuel press, the
# strongbox and the Fleet's offer; then the contract: the boom, three filter crates, the Rookery's drop, the receipt.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Fleetbreak Moorings
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Free Fleet
zone chart_room
expect step 1
read Free Fleet articles
expect step 2
open Bosun's locker
wait 3
expect step 3
use gardenvines
expect hidden gardenvines
zone roof_garden
expect step 4
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 5
open Fuel tank crate
wait 3
expect step 6
open Fuel store
wait 3
expect step 7
read Teo's log
expect step 8
open Biofuel press
wait 3
expect step 9
open Fleet strongbox
wait 3
expect story authpass 1
expect step 10
zone gull_ridge
expect step 11
read Harbourmaster's ledger
expect step 12
open Seaplane's crate
wait 3
expect step 13
zone bosuns_cave
expect step 14
read Fleet contract offer
expect done
expect step 0 quest=2
expect title Filters Past the Boom quest=2
zone boom
expect step 1 quest=2
openat 27 -31
openat 45.5 8
openat -41.5 14
expect story filtercrate 3
expect step 2 quest=2
zone rookery_drop
expect step 3 quest=2
read Fleet receipt
expect step 4 quest=2
open Fleet reward
wait 3
expect done quest=2
